{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56896","headline":"荆门县人送裴均入朝谣（题拟） · 佚名","name":"荆门县人送裴均入朝谣（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"起我堙废而远之，徕我荡析而安之。\n昔室于墟，风摇雨濡，自公优柔，郛閈盈兮。\n昔饮於洿，夏溷冬枯，自公感通，觱沸生兮。\n淑旗之华兮，四牡之騑。\n傒公之还兮，觞以祝之。\n（见同书卷九《复荆门县记》引。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}